# VGC Core — native screen spoof (screen.width/height/avail*/colorDepth/pixelDepth)
# STATUS: ✅ VERIFIED — real, git-apply-able diff (built + validated on M151, screen.width
# returns the spoofed value from a NATIVE getter — no JS override, isNativeGetter=true).
# Reads --vgc-screen=WIDTHxHEIGHT (+ optional --vgc-color-depth). REQUIRES "vgc-screen" and
# "vgc-color-depth" in kVgcSwitches (02-forward-vgc-switches.patch) so the RENDERER sees them.
# App wires the switches in profile-manager.ts; the native-mode guard (webrtc-guard.ts) then
# auto-detects native screen (__vgcScreenNative) and drops its JS Screen getters.
